ier years I got a big box of minis and paid a friend to paint some. Never kept more than a handful. Maybe if you were really into their fandom this would work for  you.", "timestamp_created": 1518180702, "timestamp_updated": 1518180702, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.34890410304069519", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "39930450", "author": {"steamid": "76561198065898049", "personaname": "trust our heart", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198065898049/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 99, "playtime_forever": 182, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 167, "last_played": 1533571519, "avatar": "eabab7f4f727e023da07d46a2094c6d45ea508b2"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's fixed. \nEverything is fine.\nGood game.", "timestamp_created": 1518098326, "timestamp_updated": 1520758063, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.495626837015151978", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}